ps5: refresh-rate selection = a VRR mode for the video - the lowest multiple of
its frame rate within 48-120 Hz - whenever "Adjust display refresh rate" is
not Off; when Kodi switches and switches back stays Kodi's (On start/stop,
Always, On start). Replaces 0010's fixed-rate rule.

--- a/xbmc/windowing/Resolution.cpp	2026-09-26 16:22:53.640703605 +0000
